              key = "Image:getPixel",
              module = "lovr.data",
              notes = "The following texture formats are supported:\n\n- `r8`\n- `rg8`\n- `rgba8`\n- `bgra8`\n- `r16`\n- `rg16`\n- `rgba16`\n- `r16f`\n- `rg16f`\n- `rgba16f`\n- `r32f`\n- `rg32f`\n- `rgba32f`\n- `rgb565`\n- `rgb5a1`\n- `rgb10a2`\n\nFormats that don't have an alpha component will return 1.0 for alpha.",
